		"openingCompanyPrologueCreditsHeldForTheConversionFirstBoat": "{0} 星币留作改装费用 / 第一架穿梭机和小队物资已预付",
		"openingCompanyPrologueConversionPaymentDueFromFleetFundsPreparation": "改装款由舰队资金支付 / 整备物资已预付",
